request. Neither speaker receives credit or penalty for excluded material. These scores assess the formal rounds and closings, not the complete recording."},{"id":"shermer-vandeweghe-jesus-miracles-2019","number":"288","notice":"This assessment covers both formal opening statements and rebuttals (approximately 6:56–1:11:59), plus both closing statements (1:49:07–1:58:23). The entire moderated discussion and audience Q&A, including both speakers’ answers and dependent replies, and the introductory montage and surrounding host remarks are excluded at the editor’s request. Neither speaker receives credit or penalty for excluded material. These scores assess the formal rounds and closings, not the complete recording."},{"id":"wielenberg-johnson-objective-morality-2020","number":"289","notice":"This assessment covers only the debaters’ direct exchange (approximately 33:05–1:13:25), as approved by the editor. The introductory position discussion, audience questions and all dependent answers, including the final reply to an audience question, are excluded. This recording has no separate formal opening speeches or paired closing statements. Neither speaker receives credit, penalties, or an inference of failing to reply from excluded material. These scores assess the direct exchange, not the complete recording."}],"year":"2020","videoId":"bg2WK-IIrd8","modelLabel":"5.6 Sol","tagCount":3,"people":[{"name":"Adam Lloyd Johnson","slug":"adam-lloyd-johnson"},{"name":"Erik Wielenberg","slug":"erik-wielenberg"}],"graph":{"sectionSideScores":3180,"minimum":48,"maximum":95,"buckets":[{"range":"48–49","count":1},{"range":"50–51","count":1},{"range":"52–53","count":1},{"range":"54–55","count":1},{"range":"56–57","count":3},{"range":"58–59","count":9},{"range":"60–61","count":10},{"range":"62–63","count":14},{"range":"64–65","count":37},{"range":"66–67","count":53},{"range":"68–69","count":77},{"range":"70–71","count":135},{"range":"72–73","count":187},{"range":"74–75","count":198},{"ra